<title>NEW ZEALAND: NZ s/adj retail sales rise 3.4 pct in Jan.</title>
<headline>NZ s/adj retail sales rise 3.4 pct in Jan.</headline>
<dateline>WELLINGTON 1996-03-17</dateline>
<text>
<p>Statistics New Zealand (SNZ) on Monday released the following retail sales data for January 1997.</p>
<p>Revised from figures are in brackets.</p>
<p>Seasonally-adjusted, month-on-month:</p>
<p>    Jan 1997		  Dec 1996	     Jan 1996</p>
<p>     +3.4 pct	     -1.0 (-1.1) pct	+3.0 pct</p>
<p>Total actual retail sales (percentage change from same month previous year):</p>
<p>    Jan 1997		  Dec 1996	     Jan 1996</p>
<p>    +2.4 pct		  +1.6 pct	     +5.2 pct</p>
<p>-- Wellington newsroom (64 4) 473 4746</p>
</text>
